  "live_records": {
    "q-182512": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182512",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$\\,$ If you don't water the plants, then they will die.\n\nWhich statement is logically equivalent to the conditional statement above?",
      "worked_solution": "Let's denote by $A$ and $B$ the following statements:\n\n- $A:$ You don't water the plants.\n\n- $B:$ The plants will die.\n\nThen, our initial statement can be written as $A⇒B,$ which is logically equivalent to \n\n$$\n¬A∨B.\n$$\n\nThe negation of $A$ can be written as\n\n- $¬A:$ You water the plants.\n\nTherefore, the given statement is logically equivalent to the following:\n\n$\\,$ You water the plants, or the plants will die.\n\nWe can write this in more everyday language as follows:\n\n$\\,$ Water the plants, or they will die.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182512-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Water the plants, or they will die.",
              "html": "Water the plants, or they will die."
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182512-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Either you do not water the plants, or they will die.",
              "html": "Either you do not water the plants, or they will die."
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182512-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Don't water the plants, and they won't die.",
              "html": "Don't water the plants, and they won't die."
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182512-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Either you do not water the plants, or they won't die.",
              "html": "Either you do not water the plants, or they won't die."
            },
            {
              "option": "e",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-182512-e",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Water the plants, or they won't die.",
              "html": "Water the plants, or they won't die."
            }
          ],
          "choices_complete": true
        }
